  "title": "SJRES 20 (118th Congress): A joint resolution providing for congressional disapproval under chapter 8 of title 5, United States Code, of the rule submitted by the Department of Justice and the Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms and Explosives relating to \"Factoring Criteria for Firearms With Attached 'Stabilizing Braces'\".",
