  ],
  "version": "as-filed",
  "operative_text": "Sec. 1 (resolving clause, disapproving ATF rule): That Congress disapproves the rule submitted by the Department of Justice and the Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms and Explosives relating to Factoring Criteria for Firearms With Attached Stabilizing Braces (88 Fed. Reg. 6478 (January 31, 2023)), and such rule shall have no force or effect.",
